#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:225
msgid "Speculative decoding"
msgstr "推测解码"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:226
msgid "Some models ship a small paired drafter checkpoint that predicts several tokens ahead, which the target model then verifies in one pass. Output is unchanged, decoding gets faster. Gemma 4 calls this multi-token prediction (MTP) and publishes a ``*-it-assistant`` drafter for every variant."
msgstr "有些模型配有小型草稿模型检查点，用来提前预测多个 token，再由目标模型一次验证。输出保持不变，解码速度则会提高。Gemma 4 将此称为多 token 预测（MTP），并为每种规格发布了对应的 ``*-it-assistant`` 草稿模型。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:231
msgid "Pass ``--enable_mtp true`` at launch to download the drafter declared by the model spec and run it alongside the target model:"
msgstr "启动时传入 ``--enable_mtp true``，即可下载模型规格中声明的草稿模型，并与目标模型一起运行："

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:240
msgid "In the Web UI the same options live under *Advanced Configuration → Speculative Decoding*, which only appears for a format/size that actually ships a drafter."
msgstr "在 Web UI 中，对应选项位于 *高级配置 → 推测解码* 下，仅在所选格式和规格提供草稿模型时显示。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:243
msgid "Optional parameters:"
msgstr "可选参数："

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:245
msgid "``--num_speculative_tokens <n>``: how many tokens the drafter proposes per round, including the bonus token. Left unset, MLX reads it from the drafter, which runs at the depth it was trained for (``4`` for Gemma 4). Gemma 4 on llama.cpp, vLLM, and SGLang follows the same model-size recipe: ``2`` for E2B, ``4`` for E4B and 26B-A4B, and the lower end (``4``) of the recommended ``4-8`` range for 12B and 31B. Other llama.cpp models keep xllamacpp's own default."
msgstr "``--num_speculative_tokens <n>``：每轮提议的 token 数量，包含额外的奖励 token。未设置时，MLX 从草稿模型读取该值，使用其训练时的深度（Gemma 4 为 ``4`` ）。Gemma 4 在 llama.cpp、vLLM 和 SGLang 上使用相同的规格配置：E2B 为 ``2``，E4B 和 26B-A4B 为 ``4``，12B 和 31B 则取建议范围 ``4-8`` 的下限（``4`` ）。其他 llama.cpp 模型保留 xllamacpp 自身的默认值。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:252
msgid "``--draft_quantization <quantization>``: which drafter conversion to use, when the spec declares more than one — the MLX build of Gemma 4 12B publishes eight. Defaults to the first declared, which is the least quantized one: a drafter is small and quantizing it costs acceptance rate, so pairing a quantized target with an unquantized drafter is the recommended setup."
msgstr "``--draft_quantization <quantization>``：当模型规格声明了多个草稿模型转换版本时，指定使用哪一个。Gemma 4 12B 的 MLX 版本提供了八种。默认使用第一个声明的版本，也就是量化程度最低的版本：草稿模型本身很小，而量化会降低接受率，因此建议将量化后的目标模型与未量化的草稿模型配合使用。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:257
msgid "``--draft_model_path <path>``: use a local drafter instead of the one declared by the spec. Implies ``--enable_mtp true``."
msgstr "``--draft_model_path <path>``：使用本地草稿模型，替代模型规格中声明的版本。设置此参数会自动启用 ``--enable_mtp true``。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:260
msgid "The drafter must match the target model family and size — it shares the target's KV cache, so a mismatched checkpoint is rejected rather than silently degrading."
msgstr "草稿模型的系列和规格必须与目标模型匹配，因为两者共享目标模型的 KV 缓存。不匹配的检查点会被拒绝，而不是在不提示的情况下影响结果。"

