#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:289
msgid "Served by the MLX vision engine, the one that runs multimodal models such as Gemma 4. The drafter is validated against the target when the model loads."
msgstr "由 MLX 视觉引擎提供支持，该引擎也用于运行 Gemma 4 等多模态模型。加载模型时会检查草稿模型是否与目标模型匹配。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:292
msgid ":ref:`llama.cpp <llama_cpp_backend>`"
msgstr ":ref:`llama.cpp <llama_cpp_backend>`"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:293
msgid "``xllamacpp>=2026.6.9713``"
msgstr "``xllamacpp>=2026.6.9713``"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:294
msgid "Translated into the ``draft-mtp`` speculative implementation. The drafter is a single gguf published inside the target's own repository, so its quantizations are its own (``BF16``, ``F16``, ``Q8_0`` for Gemma 4) and independent of the target's. Earlier llama.cpp builds do not know the ``gemma4-assistant`` architecture and cannot load it."
msgstr "转换为 ``draft-mtp`` 推测解码实现。草稿模型是发布在目标模型自身仓库中的单个 gguf 文件，因此有独立于目标模型的量化版本（Gemma 4 提供 ``BF16``、``F16``、``Q8_0`` ）。早期 llama.cpp 版本不识别 ``gemma4-assistant`` 架构，无法加载该模型。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:300
msgid "Not supported by the Transformers engine: it runs its own continuous-batching loop rather than ``generate()``, so there is nowhere to attach a drafter."
msgstr "Transformers 引擎暂不支持：它运行自己的连续批处理循环，而不是调用 ``generate()``，因此没有可接入草稿模型的位置。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:304
msgid "When it pays off"
msgstr "何时能带来加速"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:305
msgid "Speculation is only worth it when a drafting step is cheap *relative to* a target decoding step. The drafter is a small dense model whose cost does not change with the target, so the ratio is what decides the outcome — and a mixture-of-experts target can land on the wrong side of it, because only its activated slice is read per token:"
msgstr "只有当草稿模型单步计算的开销相对于目标模型单步解码足够低时，推测解码才值得使用。草稿模型是一个小型稠密模型，其开销不会随目标模型变化，因此两者的开销比例决定了最终效果。对于混合专家模型，推测解码反而可能更慢，因为每个 token 只需读取激活的那部分参数："

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:315
msgid "gemma-4 MLX, 4bit, M5 Pro"
msgstr "gemma-4 MLX，4 位量化，M5 Pro"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:316
msgid "Without a drafter"
msgstr "不使用草稿模型"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:317
msgid "With MTP"
msgstr "使用 MTP"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:318
msgid "Accepted per round"
msgstr "每轮接受的 token 数"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:319
msgid "31B (dense, 18.4 GB read per token)"
msgstr "31B（稠密模型，每个 token 读取 18.4 GB）"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:320
msgid "14.9 tok/s"
msgstr "14.9 tok/s"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:321
msgid "**31.0 tok/s** (2.1x)"
msgstr "**31.0 tok/s** （2.1 倍）"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:322
msgid "2.08 of 4"
msgstr "4 个中接受 2.08 个"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:323
msgid "26B-A4B (MoE, ~2.2 GB read per token)"
msgstr "26B-A4B（MoE，每个 token 读取约 2.2 GB）"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:324
msgid "73.2 tok/s"
msgstr "73.2 tok/s"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:325
msgid "65.9 tok/s (0.9x)"
msgstr "65.9 tok/s（0.9 倍）"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:326
msgid "1.40 of 4"
msgstr "4 个中接受 1.40 个"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:328
msgid "The 0.83 GB drafter costs about 5% of a 31B decoding step but 39% of a 26B-A4B one, so on the MoE the three drafting steps of a round already exceed one plain decoding step — and the round has to win that back from a lower acceptance rate. The MoE is still the faster model here in absolute terms; it simply has no headroom left for speculation."
msgstr "这个 0.83 GB 的草稿模型，其计算开销约为 31B 单步解码的 5%，却相当于 26B-A4B 单步解码的 39%。因此，在 MoE 模型上，一轮中的三步草稿计算就已超过一次普通解码的开销，而这一轮还要在接受率更低的情况下弥补这些开销。这里 MoE 模型的绝对速度仍然更快，只是没有足够空间再从推测解码中获益。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/backends.rst:334
msgid "So measure before leaving it on, and note that the verification step itself is not the problem: a four-token forward costs only ~40% more than a single-token one on either model."
msgstr "因此，长期启用前应先实测。问题并不在验证步骤本身：对于这两个模型，四个 token 的前向计算开销都只比单个 token 高约 40%。"
